# This file is documentation only. Gradle does not load .env into BuildConfig.
# Do not put API keys, OAuth tokens, or client secrets in this file or the APK.
# Gemini API keys are entered by the user in app Settings and encrypted in app-private storage.
# For production use, prefer a server-side proxy instead of shipping a service key in a mobile app.
#
# The Google OAuth client ID is a public identifier (not a client secret). If required,
# pass it to Gradle as -PGOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=... or the GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID environment variable.
